# Extracted bootc image roots and inspection dumps. `bootc image copy-to-storage`
# and friends unpack a full filesystem tree (~1.8 GB) into the repo, which buries
# real changes in `git status` and risks committing image content as source.
/bluefin-root/
/*-root/
/preinspect/
